+//   v3) and also keeps the centring out (an aim raised mid-reload waits);
+// - with no hip hold at all (no hip stance seen and no recording) a throw
+//   started in ADS keeps runtime v6's throw (the pose on screen, the centring
+//   follows the aim).
+// The offline harness builds the v6 hand-over tests with the define set to 1.
+#ifndef DAWN_RAT_KING_RELOAD_HANDOVER
+#define DAWN_RAT_KING_RELOAD_HANDOVER 0
+#endif
+inline constexpr bool reloadHandover=DAWN_RAT_KING_RELOAD_HANDOVER!=0;
+// ---- E.2 Diagnostics (akimbo.cpp sidearmV8, runtime v6 review: sidearmV9) ----
+// Aims at or above this are "full ADS" for the geometry probe (root 0 and the
+// presentation frame at full ADS against the last hip frame): a nonzero shift
