+//   14,15,18,19, owner (type 4, mask 0x36) 3,4. The probe allocated every
+//   selector as capacity/capacity/capacity, flags 0x12000 (local) or 0x1000
+//   (world), and collected only the local ones, with valid 1 of capacity 1, 1
+//   of 2, or 2 of 2 for bindings 12/13: the valid count is the number of part
+//   markers carrying the binding's hash (two for 5DC0744C and 5DC07452, which
+//   are two emitters each; one for the other capacity-2 hashes).
+// Only the ten local selectors below are paired; world-view and owner ones
