+//   allocation (1206F00 from 12067C6, akimbo.cpp fx_allocate_hook): a native
+//   {origin, target, pose} = {c, c, c}, flags 0x12xxx, group {valid 0,
+//   start 0, capacity c} becomes {2c, 2c, 2c}, capacity 2c; the pose buffer
+//   (1219160 from 120732A) is allocated for 2c. Only after the owner walk
+//   (firing_effects::private_owner: assembly 80BBDC90, sound 80BBDC8E, the
+//   private parents' key CF60DEE4, FX root 80EF42E5).
+//   collector (12701B0 from 121C643, after the native refresh): the native
+//   frames [0, v) (v = valid, 1..c) are the right gun's; the left gun's copies
+//   go to [v, 2v) and valid becomes 2v. Emitter i of the left gun uses the same
+//   part marker as emitter i of the right gun. Both are rebased onto the drawn
+//   guns (effects::State::capture_pair: the smoothed base, the kick, the throw),
+//   the right one included, relative to the pre-edit native root (INFERRED from
